# Scratch-model backtest, 2026 Weeks 1-7 (half-PPR, as-of)

Universe: 1896 player-weeks the live Sim Lab published and who played; market available for 1519, consensus for 1600. Importance weights = preseason ADP curve cubed (Jack's rule).

Blend weights (STRUCT+MKT etc.) are leave-one-week-out, so every blended number is as honest as the pure ones.


